<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 24px; background: #ffffff; color: #111827; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55;">
  <div style="max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Hi {{candidateFirstName}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for applying for the {{jobTitle}} role at {{organizationName}}. We have received your application.</p>
    <p>Our hiring team will review it and contact you if your experience matches the role.</p>
    {{#if contactEmail}}
    <p>If you need to update your application, contact us at <a href="mailto:{{contactEmail}}">{{contactEmail}}</a>.</p>
    {{/if}}
    <p>Kind regards,<br>{{organizationName}} Hiring Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
